nethack does not have enough conservation laws.  Conservation
violations are what make polypiling, bags of tricks, etc. profitable.
Things were worse when polymorphed wands didn't conserve charges.

If nethack were a thermodynamically closed system, then things like
polypiling couldn't unbalance the game.  (But you would need a way of
bleeding off entropy, or else the dungeon would die a heat death.  Or
else this could be used as a time limit: escape the dungeon before it
becomes impossible to survive.  But if you don't have a steady-state
dungeon then things like bones levels don't make much sense.)
